# === 敏感信息 ===
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# 用户级敏感数据（settings.json 可能含 API Key，必须排除）
**/settings.json
**/settings.local.json
**/.whale/
**/secrets.json
**/*.key
**/*.pem
**/credentials.json

# === 编译产物 ===
whale
whale.exe
*.exe
*.test
*.out
*.vsix

# === 临时/测试文件 ===
*.txt
!README.txt
# Go vendor mode requires vendor/modules.txt to be tracked,
# otherwise a clean clone fails with "inconsistent vendoring".
!vendor/**/*.txt
add.py
_fix_test.py
replace_batch*.py
replace_group*.py
replace_groups*.py
scan_*.py
test.py
test_ci_hello.py
.test-done
build.bat
coverage.txt
coverage.html
coverage.out
*.log
logs/
testing/modules/
testing/coverage.*
testing/*.log
testing/baseline.json
testing/full-test-report.json
testing/l2-summary.json
*.exe~
*.zip
worktree_cover
wt_cover

# === 快照数据 ===
.whale-snapshots/

# === Go ===
go.work
go.work.sum

# === Node ===
node_modules/
dist/
out/

# === IDE ===
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# === OS ===
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# === 文档临时文件 ===
docs/full-test/
docs/PendingWork/a3机进度记录/

